But this joystick is
actually how we control

00:37:59.120 --> 00:38:00.160
where the lasers go.

00:38:00.160 --> 00:38:03.720
And so I can move it to
catch different things.

00:38:03.720 --> 00:38:08.030
And then over here is
kind of like the setup

00:38:08.030 --> 00:38:12.220
of what we actually see
as we're collecting data.

00:38:12.220 --> 00:38:15.490
And so this is the camera
that's tracking live

00:38:15.490 --> 00:38:18.110
what's happening in my glass side.

00:38:18.110 --> 00:38:20.740
And then here is just
like a little diagram

00:38:20.740 --> 00:38:24.110
of all the different positions
