00:54:01.070 --> 00:54:03.860
Has there been any accidents
or dangerous situations

00:54:03.860 --> 00:54:06.833
that have occurred occurred
because of the C-trap?

00:54:09.010 --> 00:54:10.333
Bill says, lasers.

00:54:11.810 --> 00:54:16.410
- Yeah, I think the biggest
concern here with this equipment

00:54:16.410 --> 00:54:21.000
is the laser, but there haven't
been any accidents in my lab

00:54:21.000 --> 00:54:24.270
because like I said, again,
a company is building this.

00:54:24.270 --> 00:54:26.610
And so they've already
made sure that they've had

00:54:26.610 --> 00:54:29.530
all the safety regulations in
there and they've tested it.

00:54:29.530 --> 00:54:34.200
And basically I think I
wanted to stress the danger,

00:54:34.200 --> 00:54:35.470
potential danger of lasers.

00:54:35.470 --> 00:54:37.480
But then at the same time we
don't want to overstress it

00:54:37.480 --> 00:54:40.050
