00:54:40.050 --> 00:54:42.070
built into microscope setups now.

00:54:42.070 --> 00:54:43.590
And to really make sure that like,

00:54:43.590 --> 00:54:45.790
you won't get hurt through it.

00:54:45.790 --> 00:54:48.410
But you should always
still be a little cautious.

00:54:48.410 --> 00:54:50.410
The other thing that is
potentially dangerous

00:54:50.410 --> 00:54:53.940
about the C-trap is
actually cleaning sometimes,

00:54:53.940 --> 00:54:55.810
because we use like bleach

00:54:55.810 --> 00:54:57.710
